, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids in Orange County shows September to October under 90% of normal in 39 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025, the middle came in at 45% for August to September and 40% for October to November. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 41% on the middle of the grids. Grid 21807 had its driest year in 1963 at 66%.</p>"}
